      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Sunseeker was referred by a friend of ours. Abs was really polite and helpful. We received multiple quotes and got confused. He made it simple and was honest. So hard to find honest tradesman like that nowadays. His price was very reasonable compared to others. The installation went well with no issues at all. Glad we chose a local supplier. After the installation was done, Abs organised all our metering with the retailer and even done it himself as he is licensed to do them. No other company offered that. He kept in touch with us and was patient in explaining how the monitoring worked a few times. We would highly recommend Sunseeker to anyone. This was one of the best trade exoeriences we have had. We just thought we would share this on here as this website was very informative and we realised we can do so for Sunseeker. Thank you",
